[351-NET-0022](351-NET-0022-tls-without-the-device-certificate.done) (`BADGE_TLS_NO_DEVICE`), [000-KRN-0109](000-KRN-0109-the-shells-clients-may-badge-for-programs.done) (`SLOT_TLS` with `CAP_BADGE`).
